[2026-06-07T16:21:09.730Z] [INFO] {"body":"## Summary\n\n- Add relative pipeline scheduling with months/days/hours/minutes, previous/next references, Russian relative labels, disabled inactive timing fields, and schedule border states.\n- Keep disabled relative publish dates current when their reference stage date changes.\n- Replace pipeline-specific visualizer presets with saved visualizer presets, including flat saved preset objects from the sidebar.\n- Add album track file picking plus per-stage file reset buttons.\n- Replace raw YouTube playlist ID fields with playlist checklist/create controls while preserving playlist ID upload metadata.\n- Add a completion report for YouTube uploads sorted by publish date.\n- Add per-stage and standalone YouTube playlist IDs, playlistItems insertion, combined OAuth scope handling, and preserved upload form options from PR #126.\n- Constrain generated tooltips so long labels wrap inside the viewport.\n- Preserve issue/PR/CI/git data, downloaded reviewer screenshot, verification logs, and root-cause analysis under `docs/case-studies/issue-131`.\n\nFixes Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization#131\n\n## Screenshot\n\n![Pipeline scheduling](https://github.com/konard/Jhon-Crow-audio-recorder-with-visualization/blob/issue-131-06cd8d2fd62d/docs/case-studies/issue-131/assets/pipeline-scheduling.png?raw=true)\n\n## Case Study Artifacts\n\n- Analysis: `docs/case-studies/issue-131/analysis.md`\n- Reviewer tooltip screenshot: `docs/case-studies/issue-131/assets/pr-comment-4641540167-tooltip.png`\n- Raw issue/PR/CI/git data and verification logs: `docs/case-studies/issue-131/logs/`\n\n## Tests\n\n- `npm run lint`\n- `npm run typecheck`\n- `npm test`\n- `npm run build`\n- `npx cypress run --spec cypress/e2e/pipeline-mode.cy.js`\n- `npx cypress run --spec cypress/e2e/youtube-upload-ui.cy.js`\n- `npx cypress run` (55 passing)\n","headRefName":"issue-131-06cd8d2fd62d","headRepository":{"id":"R_kgDOQyCOvA","name":"Jh
