der if the default timeout is also 2 minutes. The user mentioned not to set a custom timeout, but last time it was around 1:53 — so it might be tight. If it exceeds, the session continues anyway. I'll run full Cypress but probably won't commit the logs unless necessary. I could just redirect to an ignored timestamp to keep things tidy in the worktree." }], content: Some([]), encrypted_content: Some("gAAAAABqJZqFEgfpInLrYSlRcBiM0mcHZNoZn2On0GC9ZQDb7doafLBEu3-OfCh6z2HuETFdEdBh3bfbikFze3kFC_sLIrh3TRRG9xcCvvI7oskiADKoR21831WB85LklsOFt7AeMVh2ABKdygXssaQBQG2GhNZyKCoRlnbTN5R3AewNDM45m14kpgUe3VtxVjSABFuGxaksOrZY_ayHlfqIpFBu7r77TN-PRjmGtLVBcjLBMooGhZZj8e2bsdon-xn5aI2y3XzF3Dp9VKRNUBDZ46TC81o0hlZ-V3v0PHqSIf3qniKa0a-SF5sOGMqjjrZXUkAyWbsm9VN667Uvz40PhJbrz7q_KVP2R2gkZjXnshxhMDjIFOQreZoAchWh3kebY-601sITuOijCkr3s8d6SmL3mPicHS6S29H7HtSNjXCRh7QkIHlbWLWqnw9KfDmh1rGO0zpb4dqfHIddK0m5usxUSqNzChxYa-bOWorqE1c1KYx-gUxGO6YHX5Bvw9-VvkaC-QzKjeitnNeWRhSsnS2qJNZph2PNz93IXJcZphxAj-Do4rReE6snsXsrSiITYcuB0cXsSWnhIPzMWFRL8AB8AYhHGKwBADo8UR-c0Gzs5HxeQkYvhoYMH8i-4VCOuuZRVChUBhs6ysNvjoqumPQSZeAj7PrLv4wQdaWaH-HyzlBUSh_kWXnEGGsSE-DX6oixgzh0Jo6tJW4xH-gcdG9scDkeVLFlnFGquo7YknBJagOd01nMQZrsMZSyMEcZaNXBBM2OFw4d6bgaIQJ52_gIdo2h0xB59bWoL6WwyoPy3lzI3nVtvihumVXB7eC_TkNEHjI8nwckwPDEq0Y4joYe-gQjJICNVaBpbp52v8Ut5bQ6cypiR-QmN3jhDqhsX9MiX3KuCPwrrV1giX1dK4M2V8LrioBcJYu08Sy93zX2l4wo26JwbsvONEPHoX081AzUx3kxRp5YhkdG7sg_UKvR7mlYhmENHvyGYGdfmFVIsNN7XLhdxLrBis1eYesPnPeQtybStUvGwvUrzZO3i9qkBXqUgRHn9-v30VJt13cPYEnE9Z2Kxt1qNJHz4kdf4_3BVjOlw2MsQRxFZUKIjPXuHCGEDAaqol6Vvjv2lntNMUkSquiLhGYYQ2AQtqCzOyCb_L6Q9OsawkAt5xF-age2N790gJRmtj7R3P9A4SoqCSu5gDS9zSsL4VdcWMAFq3qt2Z0W3vW3CSEyEVuKyvzlM2GEQOq3JWwyiN7jiwpZKNRNFvgLGiEGj3Lw0HBZobFKumN5iUQmP18gEcwGgNlzTzPNjrve7bbeS6ce80KSDwH6XdUIZuYMJczA35zrKFgq-fY6ad7nQg6RVnJIruOeT7ch9Efssl_ww1zcdlhqArTE54nngm9drQoUIftZNsIcU4UmXqo-Lfk5emkJuxTnBBD6qwdkRTWnm0k9VoF2qMXOIFk4jKAzUaLPOoUXpUHXLsX-vNeOuhgx_y3z5Silzn0ZVL98jt4eSRmv8N_tcM_CDFHLaD9QvARpG2CtpTe2CpfTsmhkcHqpyjhd9zq7BAl3Su0Gh7LlxN4mSkUOIvEWJTL9lRy-q