[2026-06-07T16:24:51.608Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_559","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"node - <<'NODE'\nconst { execFileSync } = require('node:child_process');\nconst body = \"'`## Summary\n\n- Load saved visualization presets into pipeline selects from the app preset API, including presets loaded asynchronously from the configured sidebar folder.\n- Replace raw playlist ID entry with YouTube Studio-style playlist checkboxes, refresh actions, and create-by-name controls in both standalone upload and pipeline stages.\n- Add YouTube playlist list/create helpers while preserving the existing playlist item insertion path after video uploads.\n- Add image-backed stage and album-track preview tooltips rendered from the actual visualizer settings, resolution, colors, and background assets, with stacking fixed over the sticky visualizer canvas.\n- Preserve the latest issue, PR 138, PR 139, CI, analysis, logs, and screenshot artifacts under '\"\\\\\"'`docs/case-studies/issue-131'\"\\\\\"'`.\n\nFixes Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization#131\n\n## Screenshot\n\n![Pipeline visualization preview tooltip](https://github.com/konard/Jhon-Crow-audio-recorder-with-visualization/blob/issue-131-06cd8d2fd62d/docs/case-studies/issue-131/screenshots/issue-131-pipeline-preview-tooltip.png?raw=true)\n\n## Case Study Artifacts\n\n- Analysis: '\"\\\\\"'`docs/case-studies/issue-131/analysis.md'\"\\\\\"'`\n- Final preview screenshot: '\"\\\\\"'`docs/case-studies/issue-131/screenshots/issue-131-pipeline-preview-tooltip.png'\"\\\\\"'`\n- Reviewer tooltip screenshot: '\"\\\\\"'`docs/case-studies/issue-131/assets/pr-comment-4641540167-tooltip.png'\"\\\\\"'`\n- Raw issue/PR/CI/PR139 data and verification logs: '\"\\\\\"'`docs/case-studies/issue-131/logs/'\"\\\\\"'`\n\n## Tests\n\n- '\"\\\\\"'`npm run lint'\"\\\\\"'`\n- '\"\\\\\"'`npm run typecheck'\"\\\\\"'`\n- '\"\\\\\"'`npm test -- --runTestsByPath tests/YouTubeUploader.test.ts'\"\\\\\"'`\n- '\"\\\\\"'`npm test -- --runInBand'\"\\\\\"'` (341 passing)\n- '\"\\\\\"'`npm run build'\"\\\\\"'`\n- '\"\\\\\"'`npx cypress run --spec cypress/e2e/pipeline-mode.cy.js'\"\\\\\"'` (18 passing)\n- '\"\\\\\"'`npx cypress run --spec cypress/e2e/youtube-upload-ui.cy.js'\"\\\\\"'` (12 passing)\n- '\"\\\\\"'`npx cypress run'\"\\\\\"'` (59 passing)\n`;\nexecFileSync('\"'gh', [\n  'pr', 'edit', '138',\n  '--repo', 'Jhon-Crow/audio-recorder-with-visualization',\n  '--title', 'Fix pipeline presets, playlists, and preview tooltips',\n  '--body', body,\n], { stdio: 'inherit' });\nNODE\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
