[2026-06-07T16:26:09.250Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_583","type":"reasoning","text":"**Considering CI run monitoring**\n\nI'm thinking about how to manage a long-running CI job. I could use `gh run watch --exit-status --interval 30` to monitor it, but what if there's no output for a while? The tool defaults to a 2-minute session, but I know that packaging with electron-builder can take over 10 minutes. Maybe I should check the `updatedAt` field to handle a staleness issue and use `gh run list` to see if the status changes. I suppose I’ll just need to keep an eye on it!"}}
